      "writtenOn": "2021-04-27T13:36:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Core platform API has special handling within the ART runtime. It is not clear what the impact will be in S (or in R when S built APEXes are installed in R) if we switch from treating core_platform API as system. That change needs to be done separately from this work.",
      "parentUuid": "4141faa1_3db6dc9b",
      "range": {
