        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-26T17:48:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Core_platform is only for use by libcore, conscrypt and i18n. None of the other mainline modules will need to use this. So, I don\u0027t want to pollute their .bp files with a concept that they neither care about or understand.",
      "parentUuid": "fd645db3_fc279e5e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 192,
        "startChar": 0,
